# What deploy/Dockerfile may see of the repository (BuildKit reads this
# file beside the Dockerfile in place of a .dockerignore): nothing but the
# app itself, so no virtual environment, cache, notes, key or saga of
# anyone's is ever sent to the builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!main.py
!ars_magica_manager/
!data/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
